{"seq":2,"slug":"tracking-input","title":"追踪与输入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/xr-game-development/foundations/tracking-input","wordCount":1428,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"追踪与输入\">追踪与输入</h1><p>你在房间里向左迈一步，虚拟世界必须在你大脑察觉之前向右滑动相同的距离——慢一毫秒，画面就「拖」一下；偏一厘米，桌上的虚拟杯子就「漂」一下。追踪是 XR 里最不容出错的子系统：它把你身体在真实空间的位姿，实时翻译成虚拟相机的位姿，而人类前庭系统对这种翻译的延迟与误差极度敏感。这一篇讲机器如何知道你在哪、朝哪、动得多快。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>追踪的核心产物是位姿（pose）：位置（三维平移）加朝向（三维旋转），合称六自由度（6DoF）。只追踪朝向、不追踪位置的设备是三自由度（3DoF）——你能左右看、抬头低头，但身体前倾时画面不动，这种错配很快引发不适，所以 3DoF 如今只见于最廉价的观影盒子，游戏一律要求 6DoF。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S[传感器源] --&gt; I[IMU&lt;br/&gt;陀螺仪+加速度计&lt;br/&gt;高频低漂移]&#10;  S --&gt; C[摄像头&lt;br/&gt;低频但绝对]&#10;  I --&gt; F[传感器融合&lt;br/&gt;卡尔曼/互补滤波]&#10;  C --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; P[6DoF 位姿&lt;br/&gt;位置+朝向]&#10;  P --&gt; PR[运动预测&lt;br/&gt;补偿延迟]&#10;  PR --&gt; R[渲染相机位姿]\">flowchart TD\n  S[传感器源] --&gt; I[IMU&lt;br/&gt;陀螺仪+加速度计&lt;br/&gt;高频低漂移]\n  S --&gt; C[摄像头&lt;br/&gt;低频但绝对]\n  I --&gt; F[传感器融合&lt;br/&gt;卡尔曼/互补滤波]\n  C --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; P[6DoF 位姿&lt;br/&gt;位置+朝向]\n  P --&gt; PR[运动预测&lt;br/&gt;补偿延迟]\n  PR --&gt; R[渲染相机位姿]</pre><p>位姿的旋转部分通常用四元数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q = w + xi + yj + zk</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 表示而非欧拉角，以避免万向锁并便于插值。位置用三维向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{p} = (x, y, z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9084em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。每一帧引擎都向运行时索取「下一次显示时刻」的预测位姿，而不是「现在」的位姿——原因见下文的延迟一节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"inside-out-与-outside-in\">Inside-out 与 outside-in</h2><p>追踪按摄像头位置分两大流派。Outside-in 把追踪基站放在房间角落，朝头显与控制器发射或观测信号（如早期 Lighthouse），精度高、不受头显算力限制，但要布置外设、活动范围受基站覆盖限制。Inside-out 把摄像头装在头显上，向外观察环境来反推自身运动，零外设、即开即用，是 2026 年一体机的绝对主流。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Inside-out</th>\n<th>Outside-in</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>摄像头位置</td>\n<td>头显上，向外看</td>\n<td>房间里，看头显</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外设布置</td>\n<td>无需</td>\n<td>需基站</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>活动范围</td>\n<td>受环境特征限制</td>\n<td>受基站覆盖限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遮挡问题</td>\n<td>控制器在身后易丢</td>\n<td>头显被身体挡住易丢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>算力开销</td>\n<td>占用头显算力</td>\n<td>卸载到基站</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表</td>\n<td>Quest 系列</td>\n<td>早期 Vive / Index</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Inside-out 的软肋是「眼不见为净」：当你把控制器藏到背后或头顶，头显摄像头看不到它，就只能靠控制器自带的 IMU 短暂硬扛，位置很快漂移。所以<a href=\"../interaction-design/spatial-interaction\">空间交互</a>设计要避免逼玩家把手伸到摄像头盲区。</p>\n<h2 id=\"slam-头显如何凭空建立坐标系\">SLAM：头显如何凭空建立坐标系</h2><p>Inside-out 追踪的引擎是 SLAM（Simultaneous Localization and Mapping，同步定位与建图）。头显开机时对周围环境一无所知，它一边从摄像头画面里提取角点、纹理等视觉特征，构建一张稀疏的环境地图，一边根据这些特征相对自己的移动反推自己的位姿——「建图」与「定位」同时进行、互为依据。</p>\n<p>SLAM 让头显能在你的客厅里建立一个稳定的世界坐标系，并定义出「守护边界」（guardian/boundary）。它的鲁棒性依赖环境：白墙、纯色地毯、昏暗光线都会让特征稀缺、追踪丢失或漂移。这也是为什么 SLAM 既是 VR 的追踪基础，也是 <a href=\"../ar-advanced/ar-tracking-anchoring\">AR 追踪与锚定</a>的底层——AR 的平面检测与 anchor 正是建立在同一套 SLAM 地图之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"坐标系与参考空间\">坐标系与参考空间</h2><p>OpenXR 用「参考空间」（reference space）抽象坐标系，开发者必须清楚自己在哪个空间里放内容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>LOCAL</strong>：以头显开机/重置时的位姿为原点，适合坐姿体验。</li>\n<li><strong>STAGE</strong>：以房间地面与守护边界为基准，原点在地面，适合站立/房间尺度体验。</li>\n<li><strong>VIEW</strong>：跟随头部的相机空间，用于 HUD 等贴脸内容。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把一个该钉在地面的物体错放进 VIEW 空间，它就会黏在玩家脸上跟着头动——这类坐标系错误是 XR 新手最常见的 bug。<a href=\"../interaction-design/spatial-ui-xr\">空间 UI</a>的舒适放置很大程度上就是在正确的参考空间里安放元素。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延迟-运动预测与抖动\">延迟、运动预测与抖动</h2><p>从你转头到对应画面点亮，经历采样、融合、渲染、显示一整条流水线，这段总延迟叫 motion-to-photon。要让前庭不抗议，它需压到约 20 毫秒以内。仅靠「测准当前位姿」远远不够——等画面画完，你的头已经动到别处了。</p>\n<p>解法是运动预测：根据当前角速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>ω</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{\\omega}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与线加速度，外推到画面真正点亮的那一刻的位姿。简化的朝向外推可写成绕瞬时旋转轴积分一个小角度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>ω</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\theta = |\\vec{\\omega}| \\cdot \\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>。预测越准，感知延迟越低；但预测过头，急停时会「冲过站」再弹回，表现为抖动（jitter）。运行时通常已内置预测，但开发者要明白：任何让渲染变慢、拉长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的行为，都会放大预测误差。这条延迟链直接通向<a href=\"rendering-performance\">渲染与性能</a>里的帧预算与重投影。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>位姿 = 位置 + 朝向；游戏一律要求 6DoF，3DoF 因身体前倾时画面不动而引发不适。</li>\n<li>旋转用四元数避免万向锁；每帧索取「显示时刻」的预测位姿而非当前位姿。</li>\n<li>Inside-out（头显向外看，零外设，主流）对比 outside-in（基站看头显，精度高需布置）；前者盲区在身后。</li>\n<li>SLAM 让头显凭视觉特征同时建图与定位，是 VR 追踪与 <a href=\"../ar-advanced/ar-tracking-anchoring\">AR 锚定</a>的共同底座，惧怕白墙与暗光。</li>\n<li>OpenXR 参考空间（LOCAL/STAGE/VIEW）决定内容钉在哪；放错空间是经典 bug。</li>\n<li>motion-to-photon 须 &lt;20ms，靠运动预测压低感知延迟，过度预测则抖动。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"追踪与输入","id":"追踪与输入"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Inside-out 与 outside-in","id":"inside-out-与-outside-in"},{"level":2,"text":"SLAM：头显如何凭空建立坐标系","id":"slam-头显如何凭空建立坐标系"},{"level":2,"text":"坐标系与参考空间","id":"坐标系与参考空间"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟、运动预测与抖动","id":"延迟-运动预测与抖动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"XR 基础与设备","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/xr-game-development/foundations/xr-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"XR 渲染与性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/xr-game-development/foundations/rendering-performance"}}